{"name": "Toto's Journey", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"156\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/1d8daa952eff2b2cb99468dc551f7f88.avif?t=1785953430\" width=\"780\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/902749dcf5ac1ed570b8acccdd441bf0.avif?t=1785953430\" width=\"780\"/></span>In Toto\u2019s Journey, you play as Toto \u2014 a brave and loyal dog who has been swept away into a magical world by a mysterious cyclone. Separated from his owner Dorothy, Toto sets out on a dangerous journey to find his way back home, meeting new allies and uncovering the secrets of this enchanted land along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/32b5377c4b4f77f05112fd311576a1f6.poster.avif?t=1785953430\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/32b5377c4b4f77f05112fd311576a1f6.webm?t=1785953430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/32b5377c4b4f77f05112fd311576a1f6.mp4?t=1785953430\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/6bf0948932d2eb6a3cc268c9b81c79d2.avif?t=1785953430\" width=\"780\"/></span>You will explore a variety of unique locations \u2014 from dense forests hiding the Lion to mechanical ruins once inhabited by the Tin Woodman. Each area presents its own challenges, combining exploration with environmental storytelling.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/268442a2180866c1e357b667e03d5c07.poster.avif?t=1785953430\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/268442a2180866c1e357b667e03d5c07.webm?t=1785953430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/268442a2180866c1e357b667e03d5c07.mp4?t=1785953430\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/29e5ceb19f3f1b621a8c7d9240bb0deb.avif?t=1785953430\" width=\"780\"/></span>Along the journey, you will face a range of puzzles that test your logic and creativity. Open new paths, restore broken mechanisms, and interact with light and shadows to progress. With each solved challenge, Toto grows stronger, unlocking new magical abilities that help him overcome obstacles and continue his search for Dorothy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/425f77d83253f59158b15387bd44fbe6.poster.avif?t=1785953430\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/425f77d83253f59158b15387bd44fbe6.webm?t=1785953430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/425f77d83253f59158b15387bd44fbe6.mp4?t=1785953430\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/d3574ffc2dfdd825c2f2d8f294d843f3.avif?t=1785953430\" width=\"780\"/></span>Toto\u2019s Journey is a heartfelt adventure about friendship, discovery, and the desire to return home. Explore a mysterious world, meet unforgettable characters, and uncover its hidden truths.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Toto\u2019s Journey is a cozy adventure inspired by the world of The Wizard of Oz. Play as Toto, a brave dog lost in a magical world after a mysterious cyclone. Explore enchanted lands, meet unusual creatures, and solve environmental puzzles as you search for a way back home.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/92e1d5509cb77280e69a080068dcc16effa0d3ab/header.jpg?t=1785953430", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Exploration", "Dogs", "Atmospheric", "Relaxing", "Walking Simulator", "Fantasy"], "developers": "Hanuman Games", "publishers": "Hanuman Games", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3724300", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "8 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bSbk329I8XA", "first_seen": 1783461600.0, "review_rank": 325}